</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>With Thy empow’ring Spirit blow</l><l>And all the barriers break;</l><l>With Thy life-giving Spirit breathe,</l><l>That we of Thee partake.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy Spirit is of sevenfold wealth,</l><l>For us to share of Thee;</l><l>Grant us the full experience of</l><l>The God in persons Three.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
